[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.180",
    "end": "00:00:01.140",
    "start_seconds": 0.18,
    "end_seconds": 1.14,
    "text": "- You're going to learn"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:01.140",
    "end": "00:00:04.260",
    "start_seconds": 1.14,
    "end_seconds": 4.26,
    "text": "the top 10 classy communication habits,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.260",
    "end": "00:00:07.020",
    "start_seconds": 4.26,
    "end_seconds": 7.02,
    "text": "and no, I don't normally dress like this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:07.020",
    "end": "00:00:10.661",
    "start_seconds": 7.02,
    "end_seconds": 10.661,
    "text": "and I also make no claims to be classy myself,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.661",
    "end": "00:00:13.170",
    "start_seconds": 10.661,
    "end_seconds": 13.17,
    "text": "but what I have done is make a mental list"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.170",
    "end": "00:00:15.660",
    "start_seconds": 13.17,
    "end_seconds": 15.66,
    "text": "of the classiest people I've observed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.660",
    "end": "00:00:17.490",
    "start_seconds": 15.66,
    "end_seconds": 17.49,
    "text": "and how they communicate."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.490",
    "end": "00:00:20.700",
    "start_seconds": 17.49,
    "end_seconds": 20.7,
    "text": "So to be clear, the word classy is not about income."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.700",
    "end": "00:00:22.410",
    "start_seconds": 20.7,
    "end_seconds": 22.41,
    "text": "This list is about qualities"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.410",
    "end": "00:00:26.490",
    "start_seconds": 22.41,
    "end_seconds": 26.49,
    "text": "and how classy people act, how they handle themselves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.490",
    "end": "00:00:29.700",
    "start_seconds": 26.49,
    "end_seconds": 29.7,
    "text": "The bottom line is anybody can be classy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.700",
    "end": "00:00:33.450",
    "start_seconds": 29.7,
    "end_seconds": 33.45,
    "text": "Number one, classy people use a moderate volume."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.450",
    "end": "00:00:35.250",
    "start_seconds": 33.45,
    "end_seconds": 35.25,
    "text": "They are not loud."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.250",
    "end": "00:00:37.305",
    "start_seconds": 35.25,
    "end_seconds": 37.305,
    "text": "They don't draw attention to themselves"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.305",
    "end": "00:00:41.130",
    "start_seconds": 37.305,
    "end_seconds": 41.13,
    "text": "by being boisterous or putting on a big show."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.130",
    "end": "00:00:43.560",
    "start_seconds": 41.13,
    "end_seconds": 43.56,
    "text": "I'm thinking of a classy woman I know pretty well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.560",
    "end": "00:00:45.390",
    "start_seconds": 43.56,
    "end_seconds": 45.39,
    "text": "She teaches college."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.390",
    "end": "00:00:46.680",
    "start_seconds": 45.39,
    "end_seconds": 46.68,
    "text": "She's self-controlled."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.680",
    "end": "00:00:48.540",
    "start_seconds": 46.68,
    "end_seconds": 48.54,
    "text": "She uses her inside voice,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.540",
    "end": "00:00:50.730",
    "start_seconds": 48.54,
    "end_seconds": 50.73,
    "text": "as we call it, not her outside voice,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.730",
    "end": "00:00:54.570",
    "start_seconds": 50.73,
    "end_seconds": 54.57,
    "text": "and at the same time, she's not timid, shy or soft spoken."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.570",
    "end": "00:00:57.510",
    "start_seconds": 54.57,
    "end_seconds": 57.51,
    "text": "She never makes you strain to hear her."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.510",
    "end": "00:01:02.160",
    "start_seconds": 57.51,
    "end_seconds": 62.16,
    "text": "She uses a moderate, clear, composed, and confident volume."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.160",
    "end": "00:01:05.700",
    "start_seconds": 62.16,
    "end_seconds": 65.7,
    "text": "Number two, classy people have a tailored appearance."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.700",
    "end": "00:01:09.480",
    "start_seconds": 65.7,
    "end_seconds": 69.48,
    "text": "Appearance is part of your visual communication."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.480",
    "end": "00:01:11.760",
    "start_seconds": 69.48,
    "end_seconds": 71.76,
    "text": "Classy people look put together rather"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.760",
    "end": "00:01:13.470",
    "start_seconds": 71.76,
    "end_seconds": 73.47,
    "text": "than disheveled or shaggy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.470",
    "end": "00:01:14.310",
    "start_seconds": 73.47,
    "end_seconds": 74.31,
    "text": "They're clean."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.310",
    "end": "00:01:17.040",
    "start_seconds": 74.31,
    "end_seconds": 77.03999999999999,
    "text": "They have a recent haircut or styling."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.040",
    "end": "00:01:20.670",
    "start_seconds": 77.03999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 80.67,
    "text": "They don't wear unnecessarily fancy, flashy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.670",
    "end": "00:01:23.280",
    "start_seconds": 80.67,
    "end_seconds": 83.28,
    "text": "or trendy name-brand clothing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.280",
    "end": "00:01:26.760",
    "start_seconds": 83.28,
    "end_seconds": 86.76,
    "text": "or make a big deal out of showing off their labels."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.760",
    "end": "00:01:28.680",
    "start_seconds": 86.76,
    "end_seconds": 88.68,
    "text": "That's because classy is not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.680",
    "end": "00:01:31.560",
    "start_seconds": 88.68,
    "end_seconds": 91.56,
    "text": "about drawing attention to yourself,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.560",
    "end": "00:01:34.770",
    "start_seconds": 91.56,
    "end_seconds": 94.77000000000001,
    "text": "but their clothes tend to be newish and fit them well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.770",
    "end": "00:01:37.140",
    "start_seconds": 94.77000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 97.14,
    "text": "They may have a local tailor, for example,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.140",
    "end": "00:01:40.170",
    "start_seconds": 97.14,
    "end_seconds": 100.17,
    "text": "who alters their clothing so it fits them right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.170",
    "end": "00:01:43.650",
    "start_seconds": 100.17,
    "end_seconds": 103.65,
    "text": "I'm thinking of a classy guy I know, he's a physician."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.650",
    "end": "00:01:47.100",
    "start_seconds": 103.65,
    "end_seconds": 107.1,
    "text": "He always dresses appropriately to fit the situation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.100",
    "end": "00:01:50.490",
    "start_seconds": 107.1,
    "end_seconds": 110.49000000000001,
    "text": "His clothes tend to look new rather than worn out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.490",
    "end": "00:01:53.142",
    "start_seconds": 110.49000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 113.142,
    "text": "There may also be a level of sophistication"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.142",
    "end": "00:01:55.260",
    "start_seconds": 113.142,
    "end_seconds": 115.25999999999999,
    "text": "to a classy person's taste"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.260",
    "end": "00:01:57.900",
    "start_seconds": 115.25999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 117.9,
    "text": "that aren't immediately noticeable,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.900",
    "end": "00:02:00.119",
    "start_seconds": 117.9,
    "end_seconds": 120.119,
    "text": "like the fact that their clothing is made out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.119",
    "end": "00:02:04.680",
    "start_seconds": 120.119,
    "end_seconds": 124.68,
    "text": "of high quality materials rather than wearing fast fashion."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.680",
    "end": "00:02:07.890",
    "start_seconds": 124.68,
    "end_seconds": 127.89,
    "text": "Their outfit is coordinated rather than mismatched."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.890",
    "end": "00:02:09.450",
    "start_seconds": 127.89,
    "end_seconds": 129.45,
    "text": "If they're wearing jewelry,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.450",
    "end": "00:02:13.980",
    "start_seconds": 129.45,
    "end_seconds": 133.98,
    "text": "it tends to be more subtle rather than eye-catching or loud."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.980",
    "end": "00:02:16.200",
    "start_seconds": 133.98,
    "end_seconds": 136.2,
    "text": "Classy, people tend to have good manners,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.200",
    "end": "00:02:18.240",
    "start_seconds": 136.2,
    "end_seconds": 138.24,
    "text": "etiquette, and respect for others."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.240",
    "end": "00:02:20.040",
    "start_seconds": 138.24,
    "end_seconds": 140.04,
    "text": "They say, \"Please,\" and, \"Thank you.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.040",
    "end": "00:02:21.510",
    "start_seconds": 140.04,
    "end_seconds": 141.51,
    "text": "They greet people well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.510",
    "end": "00:02:23.520",
    "start_seconds": 141.51,
    "end_seconds": 143.52,
    "text": "They have a good understanding of manners,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.520",
    "end": "00:02:25.522",
    "start_seconds": 143.52,
    "end_seconds": 145.522,
    "text": "especially around eating meals"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.522",
    "end": "00:02:28.560",
    "start_seconds": 145.522,
    "end_seconds": 148.56,
    "text": "and occasions like socializing at parties"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.560",
    "end": "00:02:31.110",
    "start_seconds": 148.56,
    "end_seconds": 151.11,
    "text": "or introducing people to each other,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.110",
    "end": "00:02:34.680",
    "start_seconds": 151.11,
    "end_seconds": 154.68,
    "text": "or how to navigate differences in social status."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.680",
    "end": "00:02:35.640",
    "start_seconds": 154.68,
    "end_seconds": 155.64,
    "text": "If they are out to dinner,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.640",
    "end": "00:02:39.480",
    "start_seconds": 155.64,
    "end_seconds": 159.48,
    "text": "they interact respectfully with servers and wait staff."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.480",
    "end": "00:02:40.770",
    "start_seconds": 159.48,
    "end_seconds": 160.77,
    "text": "It feels as if this respect"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.770",
    "end": "00:02:43.500",
    "start_seconds": 160.77,
    "end_seconds": 163.5,
    "text": "for others is driven by self-respect."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.500",
    "end": "00:02:45.180",
    "start_seconds": 163.5,
    "end_seconds": 165.18,
    "text": "They treat people well not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.180",
    "end": "00:02:48.428",
    "start_seconds": 165.18,
    "end_seconds": 168.428,
    "text": "because the other person has always somehow earned respect"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.428",
    "end": "00:02:50.460",
    "start_seconds": 168.428,
    "end_seconds": 170.46,
    "text": "in all those situations,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.460",
    "end": "00:02:53.250",
    "start_seconds": 170.46,
    "end_seconds": 173.25,
    "text": "but because that's the kind of person that they are."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.250",
    "end": "00:02:56.970",
    "start_seconds": 173.25,
    "end_seconds": 176.97,
    "text": "The way they treat others shows their own good character."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.970",
    "end": "00:02:59.400",
    "start_seconds": 176.97,
    "end_seconds": 179.4,
    "text": "Number four, classy people make good eye contact,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.400",
    "end": "00:03:02.610",
    "start_seconds": 179.4,
    "end_seconds": 182.61,
    "text": "meaning they don't stare or glare at people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.610",
    "end": "00:03:05.220",
    "start_seconds": 182.61,
    "end_seconds": 185.22,
    "text": "or give them stink eye, for example."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:05.220",
    "end": "00:03:07.530",
    "start_seconds": 185.22,
    "end_seconds": 187.53,
    "text": "They don't use eye contact to dominate others"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.530",
    "end": "00:03:09.450",
    "start_seconds": 187.53,
    "end_seconds": 189.45,
    "text": "or make them feel uncomfortable."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.450",
    "end": "00:03:11.850",
    "start_seconds": 189.45,
    "end_seconds": 191.85,
    "text": "They also don't avoid eye contact"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.850",
    "end": "00:03:14.340",
    "start_seconds": 191.85,
    "end_seconds": 194.34,
    "text": "or look around the room nervously."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.340",
    "end": "00:03:17.610",
    "start_seconds": 194.34,
    "end_seconds": 197.61,
    "text": "They make easy, comfortable eye contact."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.610",
    "end": "00:03:19.680",
    "start_seconds": 197.61,
    "end_seconds": 199.68,
    "text": "They look people in the eye long enough"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.680",
    "end": "00:03:23.130",
    "start_seconds": 199.68,
    "end_seconds": 203.13,
    "text": "to acknowledge others and make a brief connection."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.130",
    "end": "00:03:26.280",
    "start_seconds": 203.13,
    "end_seconds": 206.28,
    "text": "Number five, classy people remember names."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.280",
    "end": "00:03:28.590",
    "start_seconds": 206.28,
    "end_seconds": 208.59,
    "text": "I ran into a fairly high-status person"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.590",
    "end": "00:03:32.250",
    "start_seconds": 208.59,
    "end_seconds": 212.25,
    "text": "I'm around occasionally who carries herself with class."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.250",
    "end": "00:03:35.640",
    "start_seconds": 212.25,
    "end_seconds": 215.64,
    "text": "She uses my name about once per conversation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.640",
    "end": "00:03:38.580",
    "start_seconds": 215.64,
    "end_seconds": 218.57999999999998,
    "text": "I get the feeling that she's doing it as a good habit,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.580",
    "end": "00:03:41.580",
    "start_seconds": 218.57999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 221.57999999999998,
    "text": "but also as a sign of respect for me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.580",
    "end": "00:03:44.700",
    "start_seconds": 221.57999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 224.7,
    "text": "She wants me to know that she knows me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.700",
    "end": "00:03:47.340",
    "start_seconds": 224.7,
    "end_seconds": 227.34,
    "text": "but people like this don't overuse your name,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.340",
    "end": "00:03:50.484",
    "start_seconds": 227.34,
    "end_seconds": 230.484,
    "text": "like a pushy salesperson who says your name every sentence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.484",
    "end": "00:03:53.130",
    "start_seconds": 230.484,
    "end_seconds": 233.13,
    "text": "as a way to control the conversation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.130",
    "end": "00:03:55.500",
    "start_seconds": 233.13,
    "end_seconds": 235.5,
    "text": "or pretend that they're your best friend."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.500",
    "end": "00:03:57.210",
    "start_seconds": 235.5,
    "end_seconds": 237.21,
    "text": "It's much more straightforward"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.210",
    "end": "00:03:58.350",
    "start_seconds": 237.21,
    "end_seconds": 238.35,
    "text": "for classy people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.350",
    "end": "00:03:59.183",
    "start_seconds": 238.35,
    "end_seconds": 239.183,
    "text": "They remember"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.183",
    "end": "00:04:02.460",
    "start_seconds": 239.183,
    "end_seconds": 242.46,
    "text": "and use your name to communicate that you matter."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.460",
    "end": "00:04:05.340",
    "start_seconds": 242.46,
    "end_seconds": 245.34,
    "text": "Number six, classy people take an interest in others"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.340",
    "end": "00:04:06.990",
    "start_seconds": 245.34,
    "end_seconds": 246.99,
    "text": "and listen carefully."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.990",
    "end": "00:04:08.610",
    "start_seconds": 246.99,
    "end_seconds": 248.61,
    "text": "They are not self-centered."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.610",
    "end": "00:04:11.040",
    "start_seconds": 248.61,
    "end_seconds": 251.04,
    "text": "They take a genuine interest in other people,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.040",
    "end": "00:04:13.190",
    "start_seconds": 251.04,
    "end_seconds": 253.19,
    "text": "and they'll spend about as much time listening"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.190",
    "end": "00:04:15.000",
    "start_seconds": 253.19,
    "end_seconds": 255.0,
    "text": "as they do talking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.000",
    "end": "00:04:18.300",
    "start_seconds": 255.0,
    "end_seconds": 258.3,
    "text": "I know a pretty classy attorney, a good attorney."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.300",
    "end": "00:04:21.201",
    "start_seconds": 258.3,
    "end_seconds": 261.201,
    "text": "He has an interesting life, but he always asks me a lot"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.201",
    "end": "00:04:23.310",
    "start_seconds": 261.201,
    "end_seconds": 263.31,
    "text": "of questions about how I'm doing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.310",
    "end": "00:04:26.310",
    "start_seconds": 263.31,
    "end_seconds": 266.31,
    "text": "He doesn't talk much about himself unless you ask."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.310",
    "end": "00:04:28.530",
    "start_seconds": 266.31,
    "end_seconds": 268.53,
    "text": "Classy people ask you some questions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.530",
    "end": "00:04:30.210",
    "start_seconds": 268.53,
    "end_seconds": 270.21,
    "text": "about yourself to either catch up"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.210",
    "end": "00:04:32.130",
    "start_seconds": 270.21,
    "end_seconds": 272.13,
    "text": "with you and how you've been doing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.130",
    "end": "00:04:34.530",
    "start_seconds": 272.13,
    "end_seconds": 274.53,
    "text": "or as an attempt to get to know you better,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.530",
    "end": "00:04:35.640",
    "start_seconds": 274.53,
    "end_seconds": 275.64,
    "text": "what you do for a living,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.640",
    "end": "00:04:37.950",
    "start_seconds": 275.64,
    "end_seconds": 277.95,
    "text": "and learn a bit about your background"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.950",
    "end": "00:04:40.620",
    "start_seconds": 277.95,
    "end_seconds": 280.62,
    "text": "as they listen carefully when you speak."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.620",
    "end": "00:04:44.010",
    "start_seconds": 280.62,
    "end_seconds": 284.01,
    "text": "Number seven, classy people pause before speaking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.010",
    "end": "00:04:45.330",
    "start_seconds": 284.01,
    "end_seconds": 285.33,
    "text": "They aren't in a rush."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.330",
    "end": "00:04:46.950",
    "start_seconds": 285.33,
    "end_seconds": 286.95,
    "text": "There's no hurry."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.950",
    "end": "00:04:49.110",
    "start_seconds": 286.95,
    "end_seconds": 289.11,
    "text": "So you'll notice that when other people speak,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.110",
    "end": "00:04:50.370",
    "start_seconds": 289.11,
    "end_seconds": 290.37,
    "text": "classy people listen"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.370",
    "end": "00:04:54.330",
    "start_seconds": 290.37,
    "end_seconds": 294.33,
    "text": "and even pause noticeably before talking next."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.330",
    "end": "00:04:56.160",
    "start_seconds": 294.33,
    "end_seconds": 296.15999999999997,
    "text": "I know a successful business owner"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.160",
    "end": "00:04:59.589",
    "start_seconds": 296.15999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 299.589,
    "text": "and his wife who also owns her own successful business,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.589",
    "end": "00:05:02.852",
    "start_seconds": 299.589,
    "end_seconds": 302.852,
    "text": "and I'm always amazed at how consistently they pause"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.852",
    "end": "00:05:06.300",
    "start_seconds": 302.852,
    "end_seconds": 306.3,
    "text": "to make sure I've finished my talking turn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.300",
    "end": "00:05:09.600",
    "start_seconds": 306.3,
    "end_seconds": 309.6,
    "text": "They're pausing to process what I was just saying,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.600",
    "end": "00:05:11.730",
    "start_seconds": 309.6,
    "end_seconds": 311.73,
    "text": "and they take their time to patiently"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.730",
    "end": "00:05:13.110",
    "start_seconds": 311.73,
    "end_seconds": 313.11,
    "text": "form their own thoughts."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.110",
    "end": "00:05:15.774",
    "start_seconds": 313.11,
    "end_seconds": 315.774,
    "text": "That's why classy people will rarely cut others off"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.774",
    "end": "00:05:18.060",
    "start_seconds": 315.774,
    "end_seconds": 318.06,
    "text": "in a conversation or interrupt."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.060",
    "end": "00:05:19.260",
    "start_seconds": 318.06,
    "end_seconds": 319.26,
    "text": "That little pause leads"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.260",
    "end": "00:05:21.780",
    "start_seconds": 319.26,
    "end_seconds": 321.78,
    "text": "to lots of good communication outcomes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.780",
    "end": "00:05:24.060",
    "start_seconds": 321.78,
    "end_seconds": 324.06,
    "text": "and it comes across as really classy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.060",
    "end": "00:05:24.893",
    "start_seconds": 324.06,
    "end_seconds": 324.89300000000003,
    "text": "Number eight,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.893",
    "end": "00:05:27.390",
    "start_seconds": 324.89300000000003,
    "end_seconds": 327.39,
    "text": "classy people have a generally positive attitude."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.390",
    "end": "00:05:29.340",
    "start_seconds": 327.39,
    "end_seconds": 329.34,
    "text": "You'll seldom hear them complain,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.340",
    "end": "00:05:30.930",
    "start_seconds": 329.34,
    "end_seconds": 330.93,
    "text": "at least not for very long."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.930",
    "end": "00:05:32.610",
    "start_seconds": 330.93,
    "end_seconds": 332.61,
    "text": "They're not all doom and gloom."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.610",
    "end": "00:05:34.020",
    "start_seconds": 332.61,
    "end_seconds": 334.02,
    "text": "Instead, they'll spend their time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.020",
    "end": "00:05:35.910",
    "start_seconds": 334.02,
    "end_seconds": 335.90999999999997,
    "text": "making complimentary remarks"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.910",
    "end": "00:05:39.900",
    "start_seconds": 335.90999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 339.9,
    "text": "and focusing on the positive aspects of the situation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.900",
    "end": "00:05:42.930",
    "start_seconds": 339.9,
    "end_seconds": 342.93,
    "text": "They tend to be agreeable and cooperative"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.930",
    "end": "00:05:46.740",
    "start_seconds": 342.93,
    "end_seconds": 346.74,
    "text": "in conversations rather than conflictual or argumentative."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.740",
    "end": "00:05:47.573",
    "start_seconds": 346.74,
    "end_seconds": 347.573,
    "text": "They may have a point"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.573",
    "end": "00:05:50.370",
    "start_seconds": 347.573,
    "end_seconds": 350.37,
    "text": "of view, and if there is a problem, they'll talk about it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:50.370",
    "end": "00:05:52.650",
    "start_seconds": 350.37,
    "end_seconds": 352.65,
    "text": "but they'll also talk about solutions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.650",
    "end": "00:05:54.660",
    "start_seconds": 352.65,
    "end_seconds": 354.65999999999997,
    "text": "They're ultimately looking for the good"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.660",
    "end": "00:05:57.060",
    "start_seconds": 354.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 357.06,
    "text": "in a situation and they focus on that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:57.060",
    "end": "00:05:59.400",
    "start_seconds": 357.06,
    "end_seconds": 359.4,
    "text": "Number nine, classy people are not long-winded,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.400",
    "end": "00:06:01.920",
    "start_seconds": 359.4,
    "end_seconds": 361.92,
    "text": "and they don't dominate conversations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.920",
    "end": "00:06:04.830",
    "start_seconds": 361.92,
    "end_seconds": 364.83,
    "text": "I've rarely seen a classy person who I would describe"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:04.830",
    "end": "00:06:09.060",
    "start_seconds": 364.83,
    "end_seconds": 369.06,
    "text": "as a motor mouth, but I know lots of people who talk a lot."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.060",
    "end": "00:06:10.740",
    "start_seconds": 369.06,
    "end_seconds": 370.74,
    "text": "I talk for a living."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.740",
    "end": "00:06:12.682",
    "start_seconds": 370.74,
    "end_seconds": 372.682,
    "text": "Still, classy people are usually concise"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.682",
    "end": "00:06:15.990",
    "start_seconds": 372.682,
    "end_seconds": 375.99,
    "text": "and make an effort to share the talk time equally"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.990",
    "end": "00:06:18.120",
    "start_seconds": 375.99,
    "end_seconds": 378.12,
    "text": "with other people in conversations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:18.120",
    "end": "00:06:20.089",
    "start_seconds": 378.12,
    "end_seconds": 380.089,
    "text": "They tend not to dominate and talk so much"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.089",
    "end": "00:06:22.830",
    "start_seconds": 380.089,
    "end_seconds": 382.83,
    "text": "that others don't get a chance to contribute."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.830",
    "end": "00:06:24.870",
    "start_seconds": 382.83,
    "end_seconds": 384.87,
    "text": "And this goes well beyond listening"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.870",
    "end": "00:06:26.544",
    "start_seconds": 384.87,
    "end_seconds": 386.544,
    "text": "that I mentioned a moment ago."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.544",
    "end": "00:06:28.590",
    "start_seconds": 386.544,
    "end_seconds": 388.59,
    "text": "For example, in a group situation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.590",
    "end": "00:06:30.210",
    "start_seconds": 388.59,
    "end_seconds": 390.21,
    "text": "I've often seen classy people look"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.210",
    "end": "00:06:33.240",
    "start_seconds": 390.21,
    "end_seconds": 393.24,
    "text": "for ways to involve less talkative people,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.240",
    "end": "00:06:35.490",
    "start_seconds": 393.24,
    "end_seconds": 395.49,
    "text": "perhaps by asking them a question to invite them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.490",
    "end": "00:06:37.740",
    "start_seconds": 395.49,
    "end_seconds": 397.74,
    "text": "into the group conversation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:37.740",
    "end": "00:06:40.227",
    "start_seconds": 397.74,
    "end_seconds": 400.227,
    "text": "Number 10, they know when not to speak."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.227",
    "end": "00:06:44.490",
    "start_seconds": 400.227,
    "end_seconds": 404.49,
    "text": "This behavior is so subtle that it's easy to miss."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:44.490",
    "end": "00:06:46.020",
    "start_seconds": 404.49,
    "end_seconds": 406.02,
    "text": "They think before they speak"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.020",
    "end": "00:06:48.990",
    "start_seconds": 406.02,
    "end_seconds": 408.99,
    "text": "so they don't say something they'll regret."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.990",
    "end": "00:06:51.600",
    "start_seconds": 408.99,
    "end_seconds": 411.6,
    "text": "In many cases, they won't say anything."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.600",
    "end": "00:06:54.960",
    "start_seconds": 411.6,
    "end_seconds": 414.96,
    "text": "It almost comes across like wisdom when you see it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.960",
    "end": "00:06:56.024",
    "start_seconds": 414.96,
    "end_seconds": 416.024,
    "text": "Classy people can sense"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.024",
    "end": "00:06:58.860",
    "start_seconds": 416.024,
    "end_seconds": 418.86,
    "text": "when a conversation is turning into gossip"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:58.860",
    "end": "00:07:02.185",
    "start_seconds": 418.86,
    "end_seconds": 422.185,
    "text": "or negativity, or heading in a direction that's unhelpful,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.185",
    "end": "00:07:04.170",
    "start_seconds": 422.185,
    "end_seconds": 424.17,
    "text": "and they know how to stay out of it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.170",
    "end": "00:07:05.730",
    "start_seconds": 424.17,
    "end_seconds": 425.73,
    "text": "and how not to say anything"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.730",
    "end": "00:07:08.370",
    "start_seconds": 425.73,
    "end_seconds": 428.37,
    "text": "that would encourage more negativity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.370",
    "end": "00:07:09.710",
    "start_seconds": 428.37,
    "end_seconds": 429.71,
    "text": "They might just smile and nod"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.710",
    "end": "00:07:11.760",
    "start_seconds": 429.71,
    "end_seconds": 431.76,
    "text": "and wait for the moment to pass,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.760",
    "end": "00:07:14.713",
    "start_seconds": 431.76,
    "end_seconds": 434.713,
    "text": "but I've seen them gracefully exit a group conversation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.713",
    "end": "00:07:16.260",
    "start_seconds": 434.713,
    "end_seconds": 436.26,
    "text": "if the tide turns"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.260",
    "end": "00:07:19.290",
    "start_seconds": 436.26,
    "end_seconds": 439.29,
    "text": "to a topic they don't want to be associated with."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.290",
    "end": "00:07:21.990",
    "start_seconds": 439.29,
    "end_seconds": 441.99,
    "text": "These are the top 10 classy behaviors."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:21.990",
    "end": "00:07:23.128",
    "start_seconds": 441.99,
    "end_seconds": 443.128,
    "text": "What else would you add"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.128",
    "end": "00:07:25.710",
    "start_seconds": 443.128,
    "end_seconds": 445.71,
    "text": "to the list if you could suggest something,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:25.710",
    "end": "00:07:28.650",
    "start_seconds": 445.71,
    "end_seconds": 448.65,
    "text": "and what behaviors would you personally like to improve upon"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.650",
    "end": "00:07:29.760",
    "start_seconds": 448.65,
    "end_seconds": 449.76,
    "text": "that we've been talking about?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.760",
    "end": "00:07:32.640",
    "start_seconds": 449.76,
    "end_seconds": 452.64,
    "text": "Feel free to leave a comment about that below."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.640",
    "end": "00:07:35.493",
    "start_seconds": 452.64,
    "end_seconds": 455.493,
    "text": "Until next time, thanks, God bless, and stay classy."
  }
]
